# The member help page's screenshots and clips are ordinary git blobs, not
# LFS. Every deploy checks out with `lfs: false` (.github/workflows/deploy.yml,
# docs/workers-builds.md), so an LFS-tracked image would ship as a pointer
# file and render as a broken image. Kept small on purpose — see
# public/help/README.md.
public/help/** -filter -diff -merge
